{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"对方没有因为他显露在意而退开，仍愿意亲近，他因此放松下来；他想进一步靠近却忍住了，也已经开始舍不得这段相处。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、安心、喜欢、克制、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"左手像心跳、右手旋律线像肩膀相贴、呼吸和体温融在一起的具体画面，需要读小字才能理解；右上角两条情绪标签也不容易成为第一眼重点。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因为对方没有退开而逐渐放松，喜欢得想靠近却又怕破坏眼下的自在，同时已经隐约感到这段美好不会一直持续。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"安心、心动、克制、微酸、眷恋\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的柔软落音像温柔的刺、眼前的好还在却先有一点鼻酸，是重要的情绪细节，但字号明显小于三块主文字，通常需要再读才能抓到；左右手的音乐画面也需要细读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他在对方持续亲近后放下了一些戒备，想靠得更近却选择克制，明明还在一起就已经开始害怕美好时刻过去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、放松、喜欢、隐忍、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的歌声忽然上涌、随后轻轻呼气并回到柔和，以及没有把心事彻底说死的音乐情绪解释，虽然用了红色，但字号较小且句子较长，需要逐句读；上一张新增的鼻酸感也不容易一眼捕捉。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三块大字都是较长的完整叙述，字号和视觉权重又比较接近，导致主次不够明确。虽然绿色的放松、红色的喜欢与收住、灰色的舍不得，已经能形成清楚的情绪线索，但每条都包含好几层意思，核心信息分散在句子中间和末尾。新增的小字又继续增加信息量。整体不是内容互不相关，而是第一眼容易先抓到几个情绪词，要再看一遍才能完整理解他为什么放松、为什么克制、为什么舍不得。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "446a5105-e800-4484-9b01-e2392c168644", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T224247659151Z", "elapsed_seconds": 101.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:44:29.069441+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c4e428ccd5aded15d811e3a33a0546507286dcd37af7d78442f5c1a2c68365e5", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T224247659151Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "93f2de17d209367fe095a412c04a985b8bd8058123fa63d82aa27fce21b03513"}}}
